{
    "title": "Rebtel: Recharges And Calls",
    "description": "Rebtel helps more than 2 million users to stay connected to their loved ones. With high-quality international calls and fee-free top-ups, we are the bridge between you and those who matter the most. Rebtel app makes your life easier by:\r\n\r\n\u2705 Finding the best deals for you.\r\n\u2705 Giving you the best available rates.\r\n\u2705 Offering fee-free recharges and calling abroad services.\r\n\ud83d\udc97 Valuing your money.\r\n\r\nWe are there for a quick \u201chello\u201d and for that special day. We make you feel closer to them, no matter the distance. \ud83c\udf0e\r\n\r\nSince 2006, we have been proud to be part of so many memorable moments. And we want to be there for you, too. \r\n\r\n<b> How does it work? </b> By allowing our application to detect when you are making calls, Rebtel can offer you different and cheaper alternatives for international calling. We use intermediary numbers so that you can place international calls at local rates!\r\n\r\nRebtel app helps you to:\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcf1 Send top-ups in a matter of seconds. </b>\r\nCuba, Mexico, Nigeria, Ethiopia\u2026 Select any destination, we send your top-up! You can recharge loved ones in more than 150 countries. Send the gift of connection!\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcde Crystal-clear international calls. </b>\r\nInternational calls to landlines and mobile phones in more than 190 countries across the globe. Excellent calling quality at amazing rates, because we know it\u2019s never just a call.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udc49 Flexibility \u2192 </b> We offer flexible options for every need. Credits, bundles or subscription plans for calling abroad and mobile recharge? We got you covered! Choose the option that best suits you. You can also automate the payment, so your loved one never runs out of minutes and data.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcb3 Payment Method \u2192 </b> Pay with a debit or credit card (Visa, Mastercard, Maestro, American Express, among others), Paypal or Apple Pay. And don\u2019t worry! Your personal details are protected by Trustwave 128-bit SSL encryption and the online transactions are processed by our internal fraud team.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Support Around the Clock \u2192 </b> Our team is available 24/7 to assist you in English, Spanish and other 10 languages via email or live chat with real people.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83c\udfc5 Best Mobile Networks \u2192 </b> We are delighted to say we work with over 600 carriers around the world to deliver the best international calling and mobile top-up experiences. Among them, you will find Cubacel, Claro, MTN, Telcel, Orange, Airtel, Tigo, Virgin Mobile, and many others.\r\n\r\nRebtel app is available in 14 languages, including English, Spanish, French, Italian and German. Our app has over 10 million downloads on the Google Play Store and more than 160k reviews with an average of 4.6 stars. \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\r\n\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Recharge your loved ones with Rebtel!\r\n\r\n<b>How to send top-up? \ud83e\udd14</b>\r\n\r\n1. Download the Rebtel app.\r\n2. Create your account.\r\n3. Tap \u201cMobile Top Up\u201d.\r\n4. Enter the number you want to recharge.\r\n5. Select the amount and add your personal information.\r\n6. Confirm the payment.\r\n\r\nSimple like that! In a matter of seconds, your loved one will be recharged! \r\n\r\nYou are always there for them. We are always here for you.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcf2 Download Rebtel app today. </b>\r\n\r\n\u2753 Have any questions? Get in touch with us! https://www.rebtel.com/en/help/contact/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rebtel helps more than 2 million users to stay connected to their loved ones. With high-quality international calls and fee-free top-ups, we are the bridge between you and those who matter the most. Rebtel app makes your life easier by:<br><br>\u2705 Finding the best deals for you.<br>\u2705 Giving you the best available rates.<br>\u2705 Offering fee-free recharges and calling abroad services.<br>\ud83d\udc97 Valuing your money.<br><br>We are there for a quick \u201chello\u201d and for that special day. We make you feel closer to them, no matter the distance. \ud83c\udf0e<br><br>Since 2006, we have been proud to be part of so many memorable moments. And we want to be there for you, too. <br><br><b> How does it work? </b> By allowing our application to detect when you are making calls, Rebtel can offer you different and cheaper alternatives for international calling. We use intermediary numbers so that you can place international calls at local rates!<br><br>Rebtel app helps you to:<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcf1 Send top-ups in a matter of seconds. </b><br>Cuba, Mexico, Nigeria, Ethiopia\u2026 Select any destination, we send your top-up! You can recharge loved ones in more than 150 countries. Send the gift of connection!<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcde Crystal-clear international calls. </b><br>International calls to landlines and mobile phones in more than 190 countries across the globe. Excellent calling quality at amazing rates, because we know it\u2019s never just a call.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udc49 Flexibility \u2192 </b> We offer flexible options for every need. Credits, bundles or subscription plans for calling abroad and mobile recharge? We got you covered! Choose the option that best suits you. You can also automate the payment, so your loved one never runs out of minutes and data.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcb3 Payment Method \u2192 </b> Pay with a debit or credit card (Visa, Mastercard, Maestro, American Express, among others), Paypal or Apple Pay. And don\u2019t worry! Your personal details are protected by Trustwave 128-bit SSL encryption and the online transactions are processed by our internal fraud team.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Support Around the Clock \u2192 </b> Our team is available 24/7 to assist you in English, Spanish and other 10 languages via email or live chat with real people.<br><br><b> \ud83c\udfc5 Best Mobile Networks \u2192 </b> We are delighted to say we work with over 600 carriers around the world to deliver the best international calling and mobile top-up experiences. Among them, you will find Cubacel, Claro, MTN, Telcel, Orange, Airtel, Tigo, Virgin Mobile, and many others.<br><br>Rebtel app is available in 14 languages, including English, Spanish, French, Italian and German. Our app has over 10 million downloads on the Google Play Store and more than 160k reviews with an average of 4.6 stars. \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50<br><br>\u27a1\ufe0f Recharge your loved ones with Rebtel!<br><br><b>How to send top-up? \ud83e\udd14</b><br><br>1. Download the Rebtel app.<br>2. Create your account.<br>3. Tap \u201cMobile Top Up\u201d.<br>4. Enter the number you want to recharge.<br>5. Select the amount and add your personal information.<br>6. Confirm the payment.<br><br>Simple like that! In a matter of seconds, your loved one will be recharged! <br><br>You are always there for them. We are always here for you.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcf2 Download Rebtel app today. </b><br><br>\u2753 Have any questions? Get in touch with us! https://www.rebtel.com/en/help/contact/",
